# Optional group: printing and network service discovery.
#
# Moved out of install/fedory-base.packages so bootstrap.sh can offer them as
# an opt-out choice. Small on disk, but install/config/enable-services.sh
# starts cups, cups-browsed, and avahi-daemon at boot, and those listen on the
# network -- so this group is as much about not running daemons a user has no
# printer for as it is about size. install/config/enable-services.sh checks the
# same group before enabling any of those units.
#
# Names resolve through packaging/package-map.tsv like every other list.
avahi
cups
cups-browsed
cups-filters
cups-pdf
system-config-printer
